# ── Personal notes & scratch files ─────────────────
# Loose plain-text (todos, chat exports, snippets) — keep these local.
*.txt
*.md.bak
*.csv
# Spreadsheets carry personnel data too, and they hide it better: a workbook is
# a zip, so a reviewer skimming a diff sees one binary blob rather than the
# names, platoons, ranks and leave balances actually inside it. The duty
# schedule workbooks are the live example. This repo is PUBLIC and ship.sh runs
# `git add -A`, so an un-ignored workbook in the tree is one ship away from
# being in public history permanently. Tools read these from a path argument;
# they are never copied into the repo.
*.xlsx
*.xls
# ...except the two files that are deliberately tracked: the import fixture,
# and the nominal-roll template (entirely invented names, and the thing a new
# operator is pointed at). The blanket rules above exist to keep REAL
# personnel data out of the repo, and they still do.
!sample_polar.csv
!docs/nominal-roll-template.csv

# IPPT result screenshots and everything scripts/ippt-import.mjs writes next to
# them (the reads, the reconciled rows, the verification CSV) carry names
# beside 4Ds. The working folder lives at the repo root by convention
# (ipptKH1/, ipptKH2/, ...) and never enters the repo.
/ippt*/
*.jpeg
*.jpg
*.heic

# ── Secrets & local config ─────────────────────────
# Anything that could carry a real API key or per-machine config.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
credentials.json
secrets.json
config.local.*

# Claude Code per-machine settings (project settings.json stays tracked).
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# ── Local data exports / backups ───────────────────
# exportJSON() / exportCSV() downloads land here if you save into the repo.
cougar_backup*.json
*.bak

# ── OS metadata ────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

# ── Editor / IDE ───────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/settings.local.json

# ── Node ecosystem (in case you add npm later) ─────
node_modules/
dist/
build/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Pipeline / e2e artifacts ───────────────────────
# Feature worktrees, Playwright output, and the generated preview seeding page.
.worktrees/
# Generated by scripts/verify.sh per branch; ship.sh sends it as the PR body,
# so it lives on the PR rather than as a file that conflicts on every merge.
EVIDENCE.md
test-results/
playwright-report/
playwright/.cache/
__preview.html
.verify-appsscript.js

# ── Agent run logs ─────────────────────────────────
.gnhf/

# ── Local reference data ───────────────────────────
# (Workbooks are covered by the blanket *.xlsx rule at the top of this file.)

# Backend-connected demo entry pages (scripts/demo.sh, and the live-backend one)
__demo.html
__live.html

# Supabase CLI scratch (project ref, pooler creds) — written by `npx supabase`.
supabase/.temp/

# Claude Code worktrees — each is its own checkout on its own pushed branch.
.claude/worktrees/
